# Goal
Add a "Reply" feature so that Admins and Instructors can respond to user feedbacks, and the users can view the responses they've received.

## Open Questions
- Where should the student/user view the replies? 
  - **Option A (Recommended):** Create a new "My Feedbacks" or "Support Tickets" page in the Student Dashboard (`/dashboard/feedbacks`) where users can track their submitted feedbacks and read admin replies.
  - **Option B:** Show the replies in the user's Profile page (`/profile`).
  - *I will proceed with Option A as it is cleaner, but please let me know if you prefer Option B.*

## Proposed Changes

### Database (Supabase)
#### [NEW] [009_feedback_replies.sql](file:///supabase/migrations/009_feedback_replies.sql)
- Add two new columns to the `feedbacks` table:
  - `admin_reply` (TEXT)
  - `replied_at` (TIMESTAMP)
- Create a `run_migration_009.js` script to execute it.

### Backend Logic
#### [MODIFY] [feedback.ts](file:///src/features/feedback/actions/feedback.ts)
- Add `replyToFeedback(feedbackId: string, replyMessage: string)` action for admins/instructors.
- Add `getUserFeedbacks()` action for students to fetch their own feedbacks and replies.

### Admin & Instructor Panels
#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///src/app/(admin)/admin/feedback/page.tsx) & [page.tsx](file:///src/app/(instructor)/instructor/feedback/page.tsx)
- Add a text area beneath each "open" feedback where the Admin/Instructor can type a reply.
- Change the button to "Reply & Resolve".
- Once replied, show the reply text in the card for reference.

### Student Dashboard
#### [MODIFY] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx) & [constants.ts](file:///src/lib/constants.ts)
- Add a `My Feedbacks` / `Support` tab for students.
#### [NEW] [page.tsx](file:///src/app/(dashboard)/feedbacks/page.tsx)
- A new page where the logged-in user can see a list of their submitted feedbacks.
- Each item will show their original message, the status (Open/Resolved), and the `admin_reply` if one exists.

## Verification Plan
1. **Migration:** Run the migration to alter the table.
2. **Admin/Instructor Test:** Type a reply to a feedback and verify it marks as resolved and saves the reply.
3. **Student Test:** Log in as the student, go to "My Feedbacks", and verify the reply is visible.
